# Model weights (tracked by DVC / HuggingFace Hub)
models/two_tower/*.pt
models/two_tower/*.bin
models/lambdarank/*.pkl
models/lambdarank/*.json
# Added 8 Oct 2026. models/cross_encoder is downloaded in full by
# scripts/bootstrap.py and nothing in it is tracked, so the directory is ignored
# rather than its weight suffixes: the previous `*.pt` / `*.bin` pair left
# tokenizer.json, vocab.txt and the three config files — 255 MB together —
# stageable by `git add -A` after a bootstrap.
#
# models/two_tower is deliberately NOT ignored this way. Its tokenizer and
# config files ARE tracked; only its weights are excluded above.
models/cross_encoder/

